    <entry>
        <title type="html"><![CDATA[Sylius Days 2024]]></title>
        <id>https://www.phpugmrn.de/meetups/sylius_days_2024</id>
        <link href="https://www.phpugmrn.de/meetups/sylius_days_2024"/>
        <updated>2024-04-18T00:00:00.000Z</updated>
        <summary type="html"><![CDATA[Sylius Days 2024]]></summary>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Jointly together with our sponsor <a href="https://www.bitexpert.de/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">bitExpert AG</a> we'll organize the second edition of <a href="https://sylius.com/sylius-days/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">Sylius Days</a> on April 18-19 in Mannheim.</p>
<p>The first day will include interactive workshops to help you better understand the <a href="https://github.com/Sylius/Sylius" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">Sylius platform</a>. This will be followed by a day filled with insightful presentations, networking opportunities, and of course, an after-party!</p>
<p>Interested in contributing or sponsoring? Don't hesitate to reach out to the <a href="https://sylius.com/sylius-days/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">Sylius</a> or the <a href="https://www.bitexpert.de/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">bitExpert</a> team.</p>]]></content>
        <author>
            <name>Stephan Hochdörfer</name>
            <uri>https://github.com/shochdoerfer</uri>
        </author>
    </entry>
